{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmhGAjyGR9nsgxKgW8Eg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd go with פסגות, but I'm not sure. It's number 1 on the list, it has the green \"הזול\" star, and it says 1,058 ₪, which is way less than the rest. The problem is that's only what the account charges. For my own index \"test\" the page says \"האתר לא אסף קרנות על test\" and \"עוד לא נבחרה קרן\". So I still don't know which fund to actually buy in that account. First thing I'd do is open a פסגות account, and then figure out the fund.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **Top of the page.** The heading \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד, לאורך זמן\" is exactly what I wanted. My \"test\" button was already selected. The boxes were already filled in: 10,000 ₪ today, 500 ₪ a month, 10 years, 7%. I didn't touch them, even though I have 30,000.\n- **The fund box.** It said there are no funds for test and there was a \"+ הוספת קרן שלא ברשימה\" button. I didn't press it because I don't know any fund name to put in.\n- **The list of accounts.** I scrolled down it fast. Every row had a shekel number, from 1,058 up to 26,861. At the bottom, אלטשולר, מיטב and אקסלנס had red bars, which put me off them. Lots of rows had a \"לא בחישוב\" tag next to discounts for soldiers, students and so on. I didn't open any of those.\n- **The bottom.** \"מה כתוב בפרסום, מול התעריפון\" and the grey footnotes I just skipped.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** \"דמי משמרת\" in the colour legend, \"המרת מטבע\", \"קרן מחקה\" vs \"בחו\"ל\", and \"מחיר להוראת קבע\". I also wasn't sure if the 1,058 ₪ is per year or for the whole 10 years.\n\n**Where I got stuck:** at the point where the fund box was empty. The page is called \"where and how cheapest\", but it only answered the \"where\" part. On my phone I'd probably have closed it there.\n\n**Other things that bothered me:**\n- Number 1 is פסגות but number 2 is אינטראקטיב ישראל with 1,303 ₪, which is pretty close.\n- Some rows seemed to be missing between my screenshots, numbers 6 and 13 for sure.\n- The amount boxes started at 10,000, not my 30,000."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3718,"cache_read_input_tokens":11736,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3718},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b4ffbc87-7561-4d92-aaae-423acd5a17e0","uuid":"b6b56717-0e29-4bbd-8b4c-cdcbecf2a6b5","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:44:12.210Z","request_id":"req_011CgmhGAXpiTnZqfvxnZARb"}
